monitoring capabilities,

00:42:04.560 --> 00:42:07.350
can all be done
outside of Apigee,

00:42:07.350 --> 00:42:10.200
too, through the
management APIs.

00:42:10.200 --> 00:42:14.010
And if you would like to be
part of this beta program,

00:42:14.010 --> 00:42:16.110
and if you are already
an enterprise cloud

00:42:16.110 --> 00:42:20.700
customer of Apigee, there is a
