of Apigee and combine it

00:42:53.820 --> 00:42:56.520
with your proprietary
enterprise data,

00:42:56.520 --> 00:43:00.180
and drive some business
and operational insights.

00:43:00.180 --> 00:43:03.450
So Apigee also provides
the data export capability

00:43:03.450 --> 00:43:08.340
